  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ISK-avrop f&#xf6;r ALEF CSO-utlysning 2025</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Internal control review of ALEF 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">During the spring of 2025, Sida launched a call for proposal for Swedish civil society 
organisations for project support between 1 and 5 M SEK per year. ALEF has 
submitted an application which is currently undergoing review by Sida. Since Sida need more information about the internal control of Adult Learning and 
Empowerment Facilitators (ALEF), a decision has been taken to contract a consultant to 
perform an assessment based on these terms of reference.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Under v&#xe5;ren 2025 utlyste Sida projektst&#xf6;d p&#xe5; mellan 1 och 5 miljoner kronor per &#xe5;r till svenska civilsamh&#xe4;llesorganisationer. ALEF har l&#xe4;mnat in en ans&#xf6;kan som f&#xf6;r n&#xe4;rvarande granskas av Sida. Eftersom Sida beh&#xf6;ver mer information om organisationens interna kapacitet anlitar Sida konsultst&#xf6;d. Detta avropas p&#xe5; rangordnat ramavtal.</narrative>
  </description>
